{"4227320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Stellar Industrialist", "steam_appid": 4227320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4227350], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a constantly shifting starfield where borders are redrawn and alliances crumble overnight,<br>you are neither a general nor a soldier — but a <strong>profit-driven Stellar Industrialist</strong>.<br>The fiercer the battles, the faster your factories flourish; peace is nothing but <strong>shutdowns and losses</strong>.<br>Venture to the frontlines, scour the battlefields for wreckage and salvage, then reinvest those spoils to expand your interstellar arms empire.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Starfield</strong>: Procedurally generated planets and faction territories that evolve over time — no two galaxies play the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heat System</strong>: The tenser the front, the higher the heat; intense conflicts boost drop rates and drastically increase your profits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Armed Intervention</strong>: Build ships and sell them to any faction — your arms deals directly tip the balance of power on the frontline.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ship Manufacturing</strong>: Dozens of ship types and upgrade routes to grow your industrial pipeline and weaponize the economy itself.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a constantly shifting starfield where borders are redrawn and alliances crumble overnight,<br>you are neither a general nor a soldier — but a <strong>profit-driven Stellar Industrialist</strong>.<br>The fiercer the battles, the faster your factories flourish; peace is nothing but <strong>shutdowns and losses</strong>.<br>Venture to the frontlines, scour the battlefields for wreckage and salvage, then reinvest those spoils to expand your interstellar arms empire.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Starfield</strong>: Procedurally generated planets and faction territories that evolve over time — no two galaxies play the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heat System</strong>: The tenser the front, the higher the heat; intense conflicts boost drop rates and drastically increase your profits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Armed Intervention</strong>: Build ships and sell them to any faction — your arms deals directly tip the balance of power on the frontline.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ship Manufacturing</strong>: Dozens of ship types and upgrade routes to grow your industrial pipeline and weaponize the economy itself.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "You are neither a general nor a soldier — you are a Stellar Industrialist. To you, peace is nothing but shutdowns and losses. Venture to the frontlines, strip battlefields for wreckage and salvage, turn spoils into resources, and expand your interstellar arms empire.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Danish, Ukrainian, Russian, Bulgarian, Hungarian, Indonesian, Turkish, Greek, Norwegian, Czech, Japanese, Polish, Thai, Swedish, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Romanian, Finnish, Dutch, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Spanish - Latin America, Vietnamese, Arabic, Korean, Malay", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227320/d3e56570e6530b5b57e510b4ae4a0838cb15657e/header.jpg?t=1786956101", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227320/19b363d6764f83b14fff2b10e1dac077dbef2d4b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786956101", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227320/19b363d6764f83b14fff2b10e1dac077dbef2d4b/capsule_